# Recordings and audio
# Anchored with a leading slash. A bare `recordings/` matches at ANY depth, so
# it also swallowed server/api/recordings/ — list.get.ts and [name].get.ts were
# untracked for their whole existence, and a fresh clone of this repo got a Nuxt
# app with no recordings API at all. @nuxt/eslint reads .gitignore, so they were
# silently unlinted too.
#
# Other bare patterns below (captures/, models/, dist/, src/) currently shadow
# nothing that matters, but note src/ is the ONLY thing keeping the 73 MB
# tools/whisper.cpp tree out of `git add -A` — tools/ itself has no rule.
/recordings/
captures/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
lwin_brpd_audio.tsv

# Build artifacts and compiled binaries
adp_brute
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.out

# Python cache
__pycache__/
scripts/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/

# Pre-trained models and large data
models/
*.ckpt
*.pth
*.pb

# op25 logs containing individual radio unit IDs — kept local, never published.
# (See the privacy note in README.md; these are the per-call traces behind the
# aggregate CDR numbers the README reports.)
# op25 logs carry srcaddr — real 24-bit radio unit IDs — and this is a public
# repo. Unit IDs were leaked once already and needed a history rewrite plus a
# repo recreate to purge. This was a denylist of individual filenames, so every
# NEW log name leaked by default; op25_if2.log reached 23 srcaddr entries that
# way. Ignore the whole class instead.
results/*.log
!results/fm_sweep.log
!results/wide_sweep.log
!results/rtl433_live.log
results/lwin_cdr.log
results/enc_id.log
results/*.clean

# Raw op25 voice-update log: no unit IDs, but 21 MB and rewritten every run.
results/op25_record.log

# Spectrum sweeps (*.csv), RDS decodes (rds_*.json), SPECTRUM_REPORT.md and the
# acars/adsb/ais captures stay tracked — they are the evidence behind the README
# and contain no unit identifiers.

# Secrets and credentials
lwin_keys.json
*.key
*.pem
*.env
*.env.local

# Source code and intermediate files (if applicable)
src/
*.cs8
*.cfile

# Web server runtime
web/listen.pid
web/listen.log
web/listen.config.json
web/listen.started
web/server.lock
web/server.pid

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Node / Nuxt
node_modules/
.nuxt/
.output/
dist/

# Local environment (hostnames, secrets)
.env

# SQLite database. Derived (rebuild with scripts/import_to_sqlite.py) and holds
# transcripts of live public-safety traffic — same local-only posture as
# recordings/ per the privacy note in README.md.
sdr.db
sdr.db-wal
sdr.db-shm
adp_brute_cuda
